    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在数轴上，$-6$ 的对应点是 $M(-6)$（图 53）. 从这个点到",
        "原点的距离等于 6 个单位线段. 6 叫做 $-6$ 的**绝对值**. 也就"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图 53",
      "box": [
        142,
        1388,
        1158,
        155
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
